{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256240/extras/f4ed48a6750980192f7826e2e07e6d52.avif?t=1771405603\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256240/extras_big/f4ed48a6750980192f7826e2e07e6d52.avif?t=1771405603 width=800 height=129 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the mystical yet cozy world of the &quot;Vivid Tale&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There was only Darkness. But one day, the gods appeared. They cleansed the world of this Darkness, divided the lands among themselves and created people. Then the gods left, leaving behind their chosen ones, the Idols. The &quot;Vivid Tale&quot; will introduce you to the story of the Idols of Sclavinia, the largest country on the continent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256240/extras/650d3c36d757a39066c70749eb62080b.poster.avif?t=1771405603\" width=638 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256240/extras/650d3c36d757a39066c70749eb62080b.webm?t=1771405603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256240/extras/650d3c36d757a39066c70749eb62080b.mp4?t=1771405603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the prologue of the main game, you will meet Siver \u2014 a young idol of Stribog who has traveled to the coronation of the new tsar to swear his oath of allegiance. There he will encounter battle comrades, fatal beauties, cunning foreign guests, an ancient monster, a nasty goose, and\u2026 the uncertainty of the future. Intrigued? Then pour yourself a mug of tea, wrap up in a blanket, and hurry off on an adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256240/extras/3bb2bc32b37b47d6c0ab9332ccc49813.avif?t=1771405603\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256240/extras_big/3bb2bc32b37b47d6c0ab9332ccc49813.avif?t=1771405603 width=800 height=129 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the main game, you will experience a vast world with a vivid storyline, inspired by the best JRPGs of the PS2 and Dreamcast eras. Explore a well-crafted world filled with the spirit of Slavic mythology and the legends of minority peoples.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete numerous engaging side quests and meet dozens of colorful characters, each with their own unique story and personality. <br>         </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy simple yet captivating turn-based battles that combine the best elements of classic and modern JRPGs. <br>          </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the stunning card art created by artists from around the world, and immerse yourself in a cozy atmosphere with professional voice acting and a soulful guitar soundtrack. Ready to embark on an unforgettable journey?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the captivating world of the &quot;Vivid Tale&quot; and become a part of its story!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2256240?t=1771405603","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256240/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771405603","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256240/2d802bd8df7940dd2d2e4e70368775e57dcbfd2d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771405603","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256240/2d802bd8df7940dd2d2e4e70368775e57dcbfd2d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771405603","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3122130,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256240/extras/f4ed48a6750980192f7826e2e07e6d52.avif?t=1771405603\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256240/extras_big/f4ed48a6750980192f7826e2e07e6d52.avif?t=1771405603 width=800 height=129 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the mystical yet cozy world of the &quot;Vivid Tale&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There was only Darkness. But one day, the gods appeared. They cleansed the world of this Darkness, divided the lands among themselves and created people. Then the gods left, leaving behind their chosen ones, the Idols. The &quot;Vivid Tale&quot; will introduce you to the story of the Idols of Sclavinia, the largest country on the continent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256240/extras/650d3c36d757a39066c70749eb62080b.poster.avif?t=1771405603\" width=638 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256240/extras/650d3c36d757a39066c70749eb62080b.webm?t=1771405603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256240/extras/650d3c36d757a39066c70749eb62080b.mp4?t=1771405603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the prologue of the main game, you will meet Siver \u2014 a young idol of Stribog who has traveled to the coronation of the new tsar to swear his oath of allegiance. There he will encounter battle comrades, fatal beauties, cunning foreign guests, an ancient monster, a nasty goose, and\u2026 the uncertainty of the future. Intrigued? Then pour yourself a mug of tea, wrap up in a blanket, and hurry off on an adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256240/extras/3bb2bc32b37b47d6c0ab9332ccc49813.avif?t=1771405603\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256240/extras_big/3bb2bc32b37b47d6c0ab9332ccc49813.avif?t=1771405603 width=800 height=129 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the main game, you will experience a vast world with a vivid storyline, inspired by the best JRPGs of the PS2 and Dreamcast eras. Explore a well-crafted world filled with the spirit of Slavic mythology and the legends of minority peoples.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete numerous engaging side quests and meet dozens of colorful characters, each with their own unique story and personality. <br>         </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy simple yet captivating turn-based battles that combine the best elements of classic and modern JRPGs. <br>          </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the stunning card art created by artists from around the world, and immerse yourself in a cozy atmosphere with professional voice acting and a soulful guitar soundtrack. Ready to embark on an unforgettable journey?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the captivating world of the &quot;Vivid Tale&quot; and become a part of its story!</p>","developers":["Lock On Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"2